data: {"id": "6479a9893430405c-thinking-parallel_evidence-2932", "run_id": "6479a9893430405c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在总结所有采集到的事实：\n\n## 实体\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4`\n- **UID**: `6d7ef0ba-939d-4371-a7d9-b332d976d782`\n- **Phase**: Pending\n- **Node**: node2 (10.2.0.50)\n\n## 支持 ImagePullBackOff 的原因\n\n1. **kubectl_describe / kubectl_get_yaml 确认**: Container `app` 状态为 `ImagePullBackOff`，message 为 `Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"`。\n2. **kubectl_events**: 记录了 **416 次** `Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` 事件，时间跨度 **96 分钟**（从 Pod 创建至今", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 7, "ts_ms": 1788415710031, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

